---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';
---
<Base title="Privacy" description="How this site handles visitor data.">
  <article class="prose">
    <h1 style="font-size:34px">Privacy</h1>
    <p>{SITE.name} has no accounts, no cookies and no analytics, and our fonts are served from this site. Search and filters run in your browser, and nothing you type is sent to us.</p>
    <p>The site is hosted on GitHub Pages. GitHub may log visitor information such as IP addresses under its own privacy statement. Links on this site lead to GitHub, stores and other websites that have their own policies. If you open an issue on GitHub you are using GitHub and its terms.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
